# Pairs with LivePublisherPinned. A re-created leaf's birth seam binds its tree id
# but seeds no block pin, so once the orphan of its previous incarnation is
# retired it holds no pin at all.
MODULE: LivePublisherPinnedSeedSkipped
TARGET: LivePublisherPinned
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the birth seam seeds no block pin
PERTURBS: Seed

--- FIND
    /\ seeded' = TRUE
    /\ MergeLeafPin(route, -1)
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: no seed.
    /\ seeded' = TRUE
    /\ UNCHANGED <<pinOff, pinInc, touched>>
--- END
